@TomSweeneyRedHat Thanks for the heads up! I investigated the `Validate source code changes` failure. The detailed CI log shows that `github.com/vbauerster/cupwriter@v0.0.4` failed to download from `proxy.golang.org` with an `INTERNAL_ERROR`, which then caused the `could not import github.com/vbauerster/mpb/v8` and `undefined: mpb` errors.

I also checked the PR diff and confirmed that #29662 doesn't modify `go.mod`, `go.sum`, `utils/`, or the CI configuration, and the branch is up to date with `upstream/main`.

Could you please rerun the validation job?
